  "title_en": "Not to have: nimam, nima, nimajo",
  "card_en": "To say you do not have something, put n- in front of the present forms of imeti: nimam, nimaš, nima. It is one word, never ne imam. The noun after it changes too: imam otroke, nimam otrok.",
  "example": {
    "sl": "Nimam otrok.",
    "en": "I have no children."
  },
